      "abilities": [
        {
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "description": "*Mundymutts hear and smell better than any other species in the Outer World.*\n\n- Mange have an Edge on all Insight Checks and Contests involving hearing or sense of smell. For example, tracking or sniffing out a hidden or disguised individual.\n- Mange can smell mana and can tell when magic of any kind is being used, or was recently used, nearby. They can even discern between Bright and Dark mana.\n- Things not native to Outer World (Dimensional Strays, Asuras, Devas, etc.) smell off and make them uneasy. This could explain their infamous dislike of the Rai-Neko.",
          "id": "xtCVs0chjv379gQjoR3o",
          "originId": "doggone-good-sense",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "name": "Doggone Good Sense ",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "pNBftPf0KJyWu6e8DCH7",
          "description": "*Bandit pups learn fast that stragglers are left behind.*\n\nMange Bandits are Fast.",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "strays-step-b",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Strays Step [B]",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": ""
        },
        {
          "description": "*You can agitate the ambient mana inside another creature, causing it to swell and expand. Performing the spell requires you to make an exaggerated gesture; exhaling a deep breath into your own thumb. Huuffff!*\n\nYou can attempt to inflate a single enemy from up to 1 Battlefield Area away.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\n- your Insight vs your target's Grit.\n- **Success:** Your target begins to bloat. By the start of their next Turn they will be afflicted by the Ballooned Ailment.\n  - Only one creature may be affected by this Ability at any time. If you target another individual, the previous target will return to normal size. Otherwise, the affliction wears off after an hour or if you will it away.\n\nGain 1 Dark Allegiance Point.",
          "id": "aan8FmbOZLyKxN8oMvCf",
          "modifiers": [],
          "name": "Mortifying Bloat",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {}
        }
      ],
