        }
      },
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "75CmZfafgYoJDrTkgBEs",
          "description": "*The cloud is more solid than you'd expect.*\n\n- Thanks to its diminutive size and Ability to solidify itself, the Tiny Unhelpful Cloud has a +2 on its Defense Rating.\n- The Tiny Unhelpful Cloud can solidify its body while floating around an object and try to grab or push over an object. Snatched items are usually dropped in very inconvenient locations.\n- If the item is being held or carried, its bearer may prevent it from being snatched by making a successful Might Check.\n- The Tiny Unhelpful Cloud is unable to carry or manipulate objects that are larger or heavier than 3 Inventory Slots.",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "made-of-sterner-puff",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Made Of Sterner Puff ",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": ""
        },
        {
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "VL3Si8qrUq2FHKbMepuZ",
          "description": "*A tiny storm cloud is still a storm cloud.*\n\n- The Tiny Unhelpful Cloud can hover above someone its host is openly hostile towards and pelt them with localized rainfall and tiny lightning bolts. This is supremely annoying and often a bit painful.\n- Doing so requires the Clouds Action for a Turn and causes the target to have a Snag on all Rolls until the end of their next action.\n- Adds 1 Dark Allegiance Point.",
          "originId": "personal-rainy-day",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Personal Rainy Day "
        },
        {
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "*The cloud cannot stray far from the creature whose negative demeanor brought it into existence.*\n\n- A Cloud can be inadvertently created by any creature capable of being miserable or unpleasant. The progenitor could be another Adversary or GMC.\n- The Cloud is able to fly and hover, but it cannot move more than 20 ft (or 2 Battlefield Areas in a Fight) away from its progenitor.\n- If the Cloud loses all its Hearts, it vanishes with an angry hmph! It will reform near its progenitor in 24 hours, assuming they are still alive.\n- It vanishes instantly if its progenitor has been slain.\n- Adds 1 Dark Allegiance Point.",
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "originId": "your-worst-friend-b",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": null,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "lmk0gf0GiZAySrWmAr4e",
          "name": "Your Worst Friend [B]",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "wjKVMqicnZrcZDicqse6",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Communication",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "The Tiny Unhelpful\nCloud can speak and understand\nLow Speech and has a small but\nangry voice.",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "originId": "communication",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {}
        },
        {
          "description": "Some Tiny\nUnhelpful Clouds may cause Ailments\n(􀂴 p268) or even blast targets with\nharmful electricity.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "originId": "customization",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "jMGflg0tZtXshBD12r3J",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "name": "Customization",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "1nt3O3jC1dCmlaCq8AXm",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Habitat",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "The Cloud will always be\nfound near its progenitor creature.",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "habitat"
        },
        {
          "description": "The smell of rain, tiny but\nangry mumbling, fallen creatures with\noddly wet hair.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "indicators",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "id": "hpcq4v9xLtLkfWNPLtcM",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "name": "Indicators",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "name": "Role Playing Notes",
          "value": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "RHFCSrdqa3O1A6E7V6nu",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "originId": "role-playing-notes",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "description": "Tiny Unhelpful\nClouds are terrible conversationalists.\nThey usually speak only to heckle,\ntaunt, and mock anyone they come in\ncontact with… even their host!",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Tactics",
          "value": 0,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "OpqbAwMFI24gRFEbY6FA",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "tactics",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "The Cloud acts in ways that\nwill help its progenitor defeat their\nenemies by:\n- Swiping, and carrying off, strategically valuable items.\n- Focusing their Personal Rainy Day Ability on any foes that seem to be a true threat to their progenitor."
        }
      ]
