      "bio": {
        "name": "Bizzer Swarm",
        "details": "**Mana-sucking menaces.** Bizzers are small flying insects that feed off magic.\nWhile not dangerous on their own, they have a tendency to travel in huge\ngroups, capable of hindering the spells of even the most experienced casters.",
