      "abilities": [
        {
          "order": 0,
          "description": "*The drone is a mechanical being.*\n\n- Immune to Fatigue, Starvation, and Suffocation.\n- Immune to toxins that target living tissue which are ingested, inhaled, or injected.\n- Drones are powered by an engine that feeds on ambient mana. If the flow of mana into the engine is disrupted then they will cease to function.",
          "id": "fnYBzZWu0z8FTuETfrLx",
          "type": "Basic Ability",
          "name": "Synthetic [B]",
          "value": 0,
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {}
        },
        {
          "description": "*As a result of overexposure to mana, the Drone now has thoughts and feelings it wasn't designed to process.*\n\n- The Drone can enter at will into an erratic, rampaging state that:\n  - Grants a Minor Bonus (+2) to Might rolls.\n  - Provides +1 Heart of Damage to physical Attacks.\n  - Causes a -2 to their Defense Rating, due to reckless flailing.\n  - Attempting to exit this state requires the Drone to make a successful Insight Check.",
          "order": 1,
          "type": "Basic Ability",
          "id": "batI5gZA8Tz75CFTc79f",
          "name": "Mad Machine [B]",
          "value": 0,
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {}
        },
        {
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Labor Frame ",
          "id": "4xT5s7QjZcBPTJcjgRrF",
          "type": "Basic Ability",
          "description": "*The Maintenance Drone's body is engineered for industrial work.*\n\n- +4 Defense Rating.\n- +1 Hearts Total.\n- Maintenance Drones are Slow.\n- Mechanical limbs strike as Standard Weapons."
        }
      ]
