      "abilities": [
        {
          "description": "*Small, but rapid fire, magical blast.*\n\n- Once per turn the Blaster Mage can hurl small balls of mana as if a Thrown Weapon.\n- Shots do 1 Heart of Bright Damage.",
          "order": 0,
          "id": "0rhN2e6qasMhIVx2H2ZB",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "name": "Magic Shot ",
          "value": 0,
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "magic-shot"
        },
        {
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "*An impressive blast that temporarily exhausts the Mage.*\n\nThe Blaster Mage can attempt to fire a large flaming sphere at a foe up to 2 Battlefield Areas away.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\n- The Mages Aura VS. your Deftness.\n- **Success:** The shot does 2 Hearts of Bright Damage.\n  - After firing Big Magic Shot the Mage cannot use any Magical Abilities on their next Turn.\n\nAdds 1 Bright Allegiance Point.",
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "type": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "big-magic-shot",
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "axDT4g5n80JwAqljsOVD",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "name": "Big Magic Shot ",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "name": "Mana Burst [A][M]",
          "value": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "Oib9adYgqKtkCP4FQM6K",
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "originId": "mana-burst-a-m",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "*With a snap of the fingers, and some prior concentration, the ambient mana around the Blaster Mage bursts into flames.*\n\nThe Blaster Mage can attempt to blast everyone in the same Battlefield Area as them with a pyrotechnic explosion.\n- The Mage must first charge the attack by spending 1 Turn agitating the Areas ambient mana. During charging, the air around the Mage shimmers and sparkles.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\n- The Mages Aura vs. your Deftness.\n- **Success:** Everyone in the same Battlefield Area as the Mage suffers 2 Hearts of Bright Damage.\n\nThe mana in the targeted Battlefield Area is temporarily disrupted and no Magic Abilities can be used there for 1 Turn.\n\nThe Blaster Mage cannot cast Magic for 2 Turns after using Mana Burst.\n\nAdds 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        }
      ]
    },
