        "currency": {},
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "none",
            "data": {
              "cost": {
                "coins": 45
              },
              "subtype": "combustibles & chemicals",
              "type": "Gear",
              "encumbrance": 3
            },
            "actions": [],
            "description": "Slow to set off and indiscriminate, these powerful explosives are best kept for strategic demolitions rather than used during combat. \n\nIn a Fight, Bombs take an Action to set, and will detonate at the end of the next Round. Bombs affect everything, structures and individuals, up to 1 Battlefield Area (or 20 ft) away from the point of detonation. \n\nBombs do 8 Hearts of Damage to any objects classified as less than Very Hard. This is roughly equivalent to blowing a man-sized chunk out of a wall. \n\n**Targets make a Deftness Check:**\n- Failure: They are Toppled and take 8 Hearts of Damage. \n- Success: They are only Toppled. \n- Objects made from Magical Materials are immune to Damage inflicted by Bombs.   ",
            "equipped": false,
            "name": "Bomb",
            "version": 0,
            "privacy": {
              "level": "public",
              "users": []
            },
            "uses": {
              "max": 0
