      "bio": {
        "details": "**One heck of a steward.** Murder Maids are trained to tidy up messy situations\nwhereas Battle Butlers prevent them from occurring in the first place. Calm and\nunflappable, they are always present when their master requires.",
        "name": "Battle Butler",
