      "bio": {
        "details": "**Service with a sword.** Servants are commonly employed by nobles, the rich,\nor the terminally busy. The unpredictable and dangerous nature of the Outer\nWorld has seen the emergence of the Killservant, employees whose duties are\nboth domestic and martial.",
        "name": "Murder Maid",
        "size": "Medium",
        "background": "",
        "type": "Folk [Extraordinary[",
        "characteristics": {
          "eyes": "",
          "height": "",
          "skin": "",
          "gender": "",
          "weight": "",
