          "description": "Individual Maids will\ncarry different Chosen Weapons.\nWhen working in groups, Maids\nwill also choose accent colors to\ndifferentiate their uniforms.\nExperienced Murder Maids may know\nMagical Murder Princess Elective\nAbilities (􀂴 p52).",
