        "subname": "Rank 5 Boss",
        "name": "Mushdoom",
        "details": "**Titanic Toadstool.** Occasionally a Funguy will get a little too angry or self-important and build up enough bluster to cause them to grow in size and strength. The resulting mass of belligerence and saprophytic muscle is known as a Mushdoom, and they have a dangerous tendency to rile up and lead their more docile brethren. ",
