        "profileImage": null,
        "subname": "Rank 6 Boss",
        "details": "**Woofing wayfarer.** Proudhounds once belonged to tightly knit clans, but have\ndispersed. A few remain in their ancestral homeland trying to eke out a new\nlife, or struggling to preserve the old one. Many have taken to wandering. The\nProudhounds seek fame and fortune to immortalize their lost clans.",
        "name": "[6] Proudhound Sellsword",
