    "image": {
      "tokenCrop": {
        "aspect": 1,
        "x": 13.979591836734695,
        "width": 55.918367346938794,
        "unit": "%",
        "height": 90.13157894736842,
        "y": 3.947368421052635
      },
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2Fn9qXCE2Ylwj8dBmy4lpo%2Fimages%2FDkiO8ITfRHVkeaHW2gi3.jpg?alt=media&token=78800518-c62e-45c8-84ff-c45730e3cac9"
    },
    "groups": [
      "- adversaries",
      "colossus"
    ],
    "isActive": true,
    "sheetData": {
      "abilities": [
        {
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "order": 0,
          "description": "*Urarani's crystalline surface feeds off, and constantly vents, inky Dark Mana.*\n\n- Attacks doing Dark Damage are reduced by 1 Heart.\n- Attacks doing Bright Damage are boosted by 1 Heart.\n- +6 Defense Rating.",
          "id": "GLdGOXG77LeFMr4XU9Jk",
          "originId": "living-nightmare",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "name": "Living Nightmare ",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "description": "- Urarani can use one of the following Attacks on its Turn:\n  - **Smash:** On a successful Attack, a pincer does 3 Hearts of Damage, and can target you up to 1 Battlefield Area away.\n  - **Swipe:** Uraranis tail can target all foes located on one of its Strike Points. On a successful Attack, the tail does 2 Hearts of Damage. In addition, targets must make a successful Grit or Deftness Check or be knocked off Urarani.\n  - **Snatch:** On a successful Attack, a pincer grabs and fully Restrains (p270) you. You can attempt to escape at the beginning of each Turn by making a Might Check. Uranani can Restrain a maximum of two enemies at one time.\n  - **Crush:** If Urarani has you in its pincers, it can crush you and do 2 Hearts of damage without requiring an Attack roll.\n  - **Throw:** If Urarani has you in its pincers, it can throw you at a target up to 2 Battlefield Areas away. On a successful Attack, you and the target take 1 Heart of Damage and are Toppled (p271). On a miss, you land 2 Battlefield Areas away and are Toppled.\n  - Uraranis pincers are clumsy tools, and are incapable of delicate manipulation.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": null,
          "originId": "arachnid-armament",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "id": "VjqkUFIgChwo7iwLQMbm",
          "order": 1,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Arachnid Armament "
        },
        {
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "originId": "mountain-of-glass-b",
          "type": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "*Urarani is impossibly large and clearly unnatural, able to devastate the landscape and cover it in its odd webbing.*\n\n- Urarani is Colossal (p435).\n- **Sweep Attack:** Gooey gossamer can be spewed from the end of Uraranis tail, covering large areas in a thick crystalline webbing.\n- The web can spray up to 1 Battlefield Area away.\n- Everyone within a targeted Battlefield Area must make a Deftness Check or be completely Restrained (p270) by the web.\n- Breaking free requires you, or an ally, to use an Action and make a Might Check. Due to the webs strength, all Checks suffer a Snag.\n- Urarani can also target one of their own Strike Points but, due to their size, they are immune to the effects.\n- **Repulse Attack:** Urarani is able to blink between The Nihility and Outer World at will, and any pests crawling along its body will find themselves standing on thin air.\n- Anyone currently resting on one of Uraranis Strike Points must make a Grit Check or plummet to the ground and are Toppled (p271).\n- At the GMs discretion the fallen may also suffer an Impact Injury (p267).",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Mountain Of Glass [B]",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "CpAU3Ng4zgq1qv60BNyl",
          "order": 2
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "Urarani can only\ncommunicate in Dream Call, but its\nspeech is so distorted that it requires\nan Insight Check to decipher.",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "originId": "communication",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "7gednMVFvxEGZYr7bx01",
          "name": "Communication",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "Variants might spray\nacid or other substances from their\ntails and may deal with their suffering\nin different ways.",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "customization",
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "LdiBT1JrxWYabZu1UbS1",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "name": "Customization",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Habitat",
          "id": "XYMFqFHM3r2iMBLIgXHA",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "habitat",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "description": "Urarani only intrudes on\nreality to expel a build up of painful\nmana. Urarani appears exclusively in\nthe Shadowed Lands, perhaps it\nresembles its original home.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null
        },
        {
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
