          "originId": "role-playing-notes",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "Created and\nabandoned by the Unshaped, Urarani\nloudly laments its own existence. It\nwill bemoan the loneliness of\nimmortality and extol the virtues of\noblivion but its actions are driven by\nunbearable suffering."
        },
        {
          "description": "Urarani is uninterested in\nfighting, preferring instead to mutilate\nthe surroundings. If forced to fight\nUrarani will target the strongest first,\nhoping the weak will flee so it can\ncontinue its frustrated rampage.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "originId": "tactics",
