  {
    "activeSheet": "eDj3Wn10tM6E1nKzpC3T",
    "id": "T7JiMi0EX2W5dQnUds7g",
    "name": "[7] Grim Wing",
    "version": 9,
    "baseScale": 1,
    "sheetData": {
      "notes": [
        {
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "Grim Wings cannot\nspeak or understand any language,\nbut can sense hostility and fear.",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "originId": "communication",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "23eqSUagqCy9amdrEWCX",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Communication"
        },
        {
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "Other ‘models’ might\nbe equipped with Mana Blasts which\ninflict less damage but cause\nAilments like Petrified or Blinded.",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "originId": "customization",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "xTmeRndjk0DNtHvReV6U",
          "name": "Customization",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "description": "The skies of Outer World.\nThey prefer coastal regions where\nthey can escape to sea if required.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "originId": "habitat",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "lsov9evpZ7PwQHHuDmzU",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Habitat"
        },
        {
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "indicators",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "Horrible screeches. A\nswift shadow passing overhead.\nBurning corpses and ruins.",
          "name": "Indicators",
          "value": 0,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "p90dicDxpmUTzk0agwSP",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null
        },
        {
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "originId": "role-playing-notes",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "Grim Wings are\nunnatural creatures, created to be\nliving weapons for long forgotten\nwars. They are only motivated by\nhunger, destruction, and a strong\nsurvival instinct.",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Role Playing Notes",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "Ko4fx2zVZWbmgRHqnP5K"
        },
        {
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "bBcZBRgDr5pDBXtJMdsY",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "name": "Tactics",
          "value": 0,
          "description": "While violent, Grim Wings\nare not mindlessly so, they will:\n- Create panic with strafing runs.\n- Isolate and pummel threatening prey with everything they have.\n- Retreat if things turn sour.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "originId": "tactics",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {}
        }
      ],
      "abilities": [
        {
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Bio-Sorcerous Body [B]",
          "originId": "bio-sorcerous-body-b",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "KIvYQFY3k7q2j7SVEq6s",
          "description": "*Constructed to revel in ceaseless battle.*\n\n- +8 Defense Rating due to its toughened skin and feathers.\n- The Grim Wing is resilient to pain and regains 1 lost Heart every Turn.\n- The Grim Wings eyes can see in blinding light and total darkness."
        },
        {
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": null,
          "originId": "skybound-destroyer-b",
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "description": "*Burning eyes can fire concentrated mana.*\n\nIn addition to its other permitted Actions, a Grim Wing can use:\n\n**Beam:**\n- The Attack can target an enemy up to 2 Battlefield Areas away. A hit deals 3 Hearts of Bright Damage and forces you to make a Might Check or be Toppled.\n\n**Spray:**\n- The Grim Wing can target a Battlefield Area up to 1 Area away. A single Attack roll is made and compared to the Defense Rating of everyone in the targeted Area. Those hit suffer 1 Heart of Bright Damage.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "name": "Mana Burst [B]",
          "value": 0,
          "id": "e857LTqEgLT5hL8joWgw",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null
        },
        {
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "ebvC1lY7DtttgbvvkTUb",
          "name": "Sun Blotter [B]",
          "value": 0,
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "*The Grim Wing casts a massive shadow.*\n\n- Grim Wings are Massive (p434).\n- **Sweep Attack:** Tail and wings strike as Arc Weapons.\n- **Focus Attack:** Talons and fangs strike as Mighty Weapons.",
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "originId": "sun-blotter-b",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": null
        },
        {
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": null,
          "originId": "mana-burst-a-m",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "*With a snap of the fingers, and some prior concentration, the ambient mana around the Blaster Mage bursts into flames.*\n\nThe Blaster Mage can attempt to blast everyone in the same Battlefield Area as them with a pyrotechnic explosion.\n- The Mage must first charge the attack by spending 1 Turn agitating the Areas ambient mana. During charging, the air around the Mage shimmers and sparkles.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\n- The Mages Aura vs. your Deftness.\n- **Success:** Everyone in the same Battlefield Area as the Mage suffers 2 Hearts of Bright Damage.\n\nThe mana in the targeted Battlefield Area is temporarily disrupted and no Magic Abilities can be used there for 1 Turn.\n\nThe Blaster Mage cannot cast Magic for 2 Turns after using Mana Burst.\n\nAdds 1 Bright Allegiance Point.",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Skybound Destroyer [A][M]",
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "h73ChKUIyNt5yv74uFvu",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": []
        }
      ],
