      "abilities": [
        {
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "HYGJKnVm4JgUATG5tzSB",
          "description": "- You make a single Attack roll.\n- The result of the roll is used as an Attack roll against everyone within 1 Battlefield Area as you.\n- A hit does 2 Hearts of Flame Damage.",
          "order": 0,
          "counters": {},
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Pyroclastic Blast"
        },
        {
          "order": 1,
          "id": "jWS913bZSipHoVC8eLqh",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "name": "Lava Breath",
          "value": 0,
          "description": "*An impressive blast that temporarily exhausts the Mage.*\n\nThe Blaster Mage can attempt to fire a large flaming sphere at a foe up to 2 Battlefield Areas away.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\n- The Mages Aura VS. your Deftness.\n- **Success:** The shot does 2 Hearts of Bright Damage.\n  - After firing Big Magic Shot the Mage cannot use any Magical Abilities on their next Turn.\n\nAdds 1 Bright Allegiance Point.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "type": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "big-magic-shot",
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {}
        },
        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Sand Shifter",
          "counters": {},
          "id": "Q1JVILIvqjSHzgENA6VY",
          "order": 2,
          "description": "When\nunder the sand the Eruptle can create a\nripple across the surface. Everyone in a\nBattlefield Area the Eruptle passed\nthrough must make a Deftness Check or\nbe Toppled. \n\nThis Ability can be used in\naddition to the monster‘s allowed Action.",
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "description": "*A Chompa's skin is tough.*\n\n- +4 Defense Rating.\n- +1 Hearts Total.\n- Speed Rating is Slow.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "originId": "blubbery-hide",
