      "bio": {
        "size": "Massive",
        "type": "Monster [Abberation]",
        "background": "",
        "details": "**The wrath of the departed.** Shadow Beasts are born of tragedy. When a large\nnumber of individuals die during a violent or gruesome event, it can poison the\nambient mana. This corrupted mana can coalesce and congeal into a terrible,\ndestructive mass that lashes out at everything that moves.",
        "name": "Shadow Beast",
        "subname": "Rank 8 Mega-Boss",
        "characteristics": {
          "age": "",
          "hair": "",
          "weight": "",
          "skin": "",
          "gender": "",
          "height": "",
          "eyes": ""
        },
        "profileImage": null,
        "appearance": "",
        "tokenCrop": ""
      },
      "aptitudes": {
        "attributes": {
          "aptitudes": {
            "aura": {
              "value": "13",
              "visible": true
            },
            "grit": {
              "visible": true,
              "value": "11"
            },
            "might": {
              "visible": true,
              "value": "16"
            },
            "insight": {
              "value": "8",
              "visible": true
            },
            "deftness": {
              "value": "8",
              "visible": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "combat-gear",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Combat Gear",
          "counters": {},
          "id": "p5pcn8c0qYrayoIAtmUC",
          "description": "What they are typically\nequipped with.",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Communication",
          "value": 0,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "ojixoDlZNLnCQQnpTVSw",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "communication",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "It cannot\nmeaningfully communicate. The\ntemporary faces that emerge on its\nbody only wail in remembrance, and\nthe creature itself thinks only\nof destruction."
        },
        {
          "id": "3YTgCRj88mR6cLIhRU1j",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "name": "Customization",
          "value": 0,
          "description": "Replace their Caustic\nMiasma with an Ability that is related\nto the originating event. For\nexample, innocents gunned down by\nmercenaries might create a Shadow\nBeast that shoots black spines from\nits body.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "originId": "customization",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {}
        },
        {
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "Shadow Beasts are only\nfound in the Wistful Dark due to the\nregion’s high levels of dark mana.\nReports from the Hollow Queen’s\nKingdom suggest they clash with the\nregion’s other curious creatures.",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "habitat",
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "qIUFGt7162sDcqu8kX3J",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Habitat"
        },
        {
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "VUBAchzHuS9jmgw9cSmc",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "name": "Indicators",
          "value": 0,
          "description": "Corpses and scenery that\nhave been melted away, dark mist,\nterrible cries and moans, an\nacrid smell.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "originId": "indicators",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {}
        },
        {
          "name": "Role Playing Notes",
          "value": 0,
          "id": "Tg08XZRGUfE1pc6mxveH",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "role-playing-notes",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "description": "Shadow Beasts\nare the personification of suffering\nand rage, they are not interested in\ndiscourse and will attack anything\nthat moves. The howling faces that\nmove along their surface are\nindividually comprehensible, even if\nthey only beg or cry. Maybe the PCs\nrecognize one of the faces?",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null
        },
        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Tactics",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "orIPvc9T3YWECmyB0k1W",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "originId": "tactics",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "The Beasts are instinctual rather than strategic and will:\n- Rely on their Caustic Miasma to clear out weaker foes, saving their direct attacks for their more powerful opponents.\n- Focus on targets that remind them of their tragic origin. For example, armored warriors may enrage a Beast who came into being after the slaughter of a nomad village by the Knights of the Sacred Chain."
        }
      ],
