      "abilities": [
        {
          "modifiers": [],
          "order": 0,
          "description": "> To strike Varubali is to defy his divinely ordained task, and prompts him to swift, furious retribution.\n\nVarubali may attack any individuals who successfully strikes him in melee. This may be a Sweep or a Strike, per his Massive Size.\n\nThese Attacks are in addition to any actions Varubali takes in the round.",
          "id": "O9OBgBOSU1BoQ52pl2RN",
          "counters": {},
          "name": "Retributive Claw",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "counters": {},
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Fearsome Aura",
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "9JAy9q0z7LvTjL7HenuM",
          "description": "> Perceiving Varubali and hearing his echoing voice fills the heart with dread and a feeling that it is against the will of the divine to oppose him.\n\nAnyone Encountering Varubali incurs an a Contest between his Aura against their Grit, if the Target Fails, they are inflicted with the Terrified status Ailment\n\nThis Ability does not work against individuals who are equal to Varubali’s Rank or higher.",
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Breath of Frost and Flame",
          "counters": {},
          "id": "wATtV15luDx8OWuDhhvc",
          "order": 2,
          "description": "> Gifted access to a summer’s gale and a winter’s wind by his divine creator, Varubali can call forth either in a torrent of fire or ice that can decimate those who dare oppose him.\n\nVarubali may spew a breath weapon with an Attack Roll up to two Areas away. This Attack hits the entire Area and does 2 Hearts of Damage to anyone successfully hit.\n\nThis Breath Weapon may do Flame or Frost damage as Varubali wishes.\n\nOnce used, Varubali cannot use this Ability for 2 more Turns.",
          "modifiers": []
        },
        {
          "counters": {},
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Lightning Blast",
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "iokIA6uExeu6fZLtQL1r",
          "description": "> When truly pressed, the divine behemoth may draw from the power of his long banished creator to strike down a foe with thunderous fury.\n\nVarubali may target an individual up to 3 Areas away with a burst of holy lightning. This requires a successful Attack Roll and does 3 Hearts of Damage on a hit. \n\nThis Ability may only be used once a fight.",
          "order": 3
        },
        {
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "5XjdgIp1vW1ARYlpaZRU",
          "order": 4,
          "description": "> Large even for a Divine Beast, Varubali towers over even the largest of folk and most other monsters. He relishes this advantage.\n\nVarubali is Massive.\n\nSweep Attack: Bladed Tail strikes as an Arc Weapon.\n\nCrush Attack: Claws strike as a Mighty Weapon.\n\nVarubali’s armored body has a Natural Defense of 16 like Heavy Amor (This is reduced to 14 due to massive size) and grants them an additional Heart.",
          "counters": {},
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Divine Behemoth"
        }
      ]
    },
