            "counters": {},
            "subtext": "The demon may spit acidic bile.",
            "value": 0,
            "name": "Caustic Spittle"
          },
          {
            "id": "consumed-by-darkness",
            "description": "- **Numb to Pain**: +2 Defense Rating.\n- **Natural Weapons**: Demons have sharpened teeth and nails. Their Unarmed Attacks strike as Standard Weapons.\n- **Shadow Sight**: Demons can see in total darkness without hindrance.\n- **Susceptible to Sunlight**: Sunlight will reduce a Demon to ash in moments. \n\n> Demons lose 1 Heart for every Turn they are exposed to sunlight, or the light of a fallen Star Shard (􀂴 p305). Star Gems (􀂴 p180) up to 1 Area away will also have this effect. \n\n> Demons can avoid damage from sunlight by covering their bodies in thick clothing and masks.\n\n- Adds 2 Dark Allegiance Points",
            "linkedValue": null,
            "value": 0,
            "name": "Consumed By Darkness",
            "counters": {},
            "subtext": "While it is sometimes possible to recognize who a demon once was, that person is gone, erased by the Blight."
          },
          {
            "id": "shadow-blight-host",
            "description": "- If a Demon’s Attack reduces you to 0 Hearts you must check to see if you contract Shadow Blight.\n- If you are immune to the Blight, you roll on the Injury Table as normal.\n- Once an enemy has been infected, the Demon will immediately switch its attention to the uninfected.\n- Adds 2 Dark Allegiance Points.",
            "linkedValue": null,
            "value": 0,
            "name": "Shadow Blight Host",
            "counters": {},
            "subtext": "The Shadow Blight is contagious, and a Demon’s attacks can pass on the curse to the weary."
          }
        ],
        "notes": [
          {
            "description": "Dark Tongue, they might reluctantly use Low Speech.",
            "order": 0,
            "type": "Quick Facts",
            "id": "communication",
            "linkedValue": null,
            "name": "Communication",
            "value": 0,
            "counters": {}
          },
          {
            "value": 0,
            "name": "Tactics",
            "counters": {},
            "id": "tactics",
            "type": "Quick Facts",
            "description": "Spreading the Blight is a demon’s primary goal, they will:\n- Die in droves attempting to infect a significant individual.\n- Target the Bright Aligned (􀂴 p206), they are the most offensive.",
            "order": 1,
            "linkedValue": null
          }
        ],
