      "notes": [
        {
          "order": 0,
          "description": "Dark Tongue, they might reluctantly use Low Speech.",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "id": "communication",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "name": "Communication",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {}
        },
        {
          "order": 1,
          "description": "Spreading the Blight is a demon’s primary goal, they will:\n- Die in droves attempting to infect a significant individual.\n- Target the Bright Aligned (􀂴 p206), they are the most offensive.",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "id": "tactics",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "name": "Tactics",
          "value": 0,
          "counters": {}
        }
      ],
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "revolting-excess",
          "description": "*The demon’s flesh has become tumorous and ponderously thick.*\n\n- +2 Defense Rating.\n- Adds 2 Dark Allegiance Points.",
          "order": 0,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Revolting Excess",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": ""
        },
        {
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Consumed By Darkness [B]",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "consumed-by-darkness",
          "description": "*While it is sometimes possible to recognize who a demon once was, that person is gone, erased by the Blight.*\n\n- **Numb to Pain:** +2 Defense Rating.\n- **Natural Weapons:** Demons have sharpened teeth and nails. Their Unarmed Attacks strike as Standard Weapons.\n- **Shadow Sight:** Demons can see in total darkness without hindrance.\n- **Susceptible to Sunlight:** Sunlight will reduce a Demon to ash in moments.\n- Demons lose 1 Heart for every Turn they are exposed to sunlight, or the light of a fallen Star Shard (p305). Star Gems (p180) up to 1 Area away will also have this effect.\n- Demons can avoid damage from sunlight by covering their bodies in thick clothing and masks.",
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "linkedValue": null,
          "order": 2,
          "description": "*The Shadow Blight is contagious, and a Demon's attacks can pass on the curse to the weary.*\n\n- If a Demons Attack reduces you to 0 Hearts you must check to see if you contract Shadow Blight (p374).\n- If you are immune to the Blight, you roll on the Injury Table as normal.\n- Once an enemy has been infected, the Demon will immediately switch its attention to the uninfected.",
          "id": "shadow-blight-host",
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "name": "Shadow Blight Host [B]",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
