        "items": [
          {
            "itemId": "Ihvlyra7OiyvE6TjNVJz",
            "isCustom": true,
            "uses": {
              "max": 0
            },
            "privacy": {
              "level": "public",
              "users": []
            },
            "name": "Solvent",
            "version": 0,
            "equipped": false,
            "quantity": 1,
            "id": "64UD3aflSjKAGFDie7Hf",
            "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
            "data": {
              "subtype": "combustibles & chemicals",
              "type": "Gear",
              "encumbrance": 1,
              "cost": {
                "coins": 20
              }
            },
            "type": "none",
            "description": "Acids and other caustic liquids. 1 Unit of Solvent will do 2 Hearts of Damage to any objects classified as less than Very Hard. This is roughly equivalent to burning a hole through floorboards. In a Fight, you can splash Solvent on an enemy with a successful Attack roll. 1 Unit will cause a Caustic/Burning Injury ",
            "actions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "bio": {
        "appearance": "",
        "profileImage": null,
        "tokenCrop": "",
        "characteristics": {
          "age": "",
          "hair": "",
          "weight": "",
          "skin": "",
          "gender": "",
          "height": "",
          "eyes": ""
        },
        "subname": "Rank 0 Mook",
        "name": "Goop",
        "details": "**Seriously sinister slime.** A consequence of another era’s carelessness, Goops\nare the sentient waste products of ancient mana-powered facilities. What little\nintelligence they possess is dedicated to hunting and absorbing prey.",
        "size": "Medium",
        "background": "",
        "type": "Monster [Slime]"
      },
      "abilities": [
        {
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "udJF5fagbc6fDdnZXoZq",
          "description": "*Goops are oddly colored, semi-solid masses that are animated by mana trapped within them.*\n\n- Goops are gelatinous creatures devoid of defined shape or limbs.\n- They cannot hold or use objects.\n- They are able to squeeze under doors and into small spaces.\n- They cannot be restrained by ropes or similar bonds due to their amorphous body.\n- Goops dissipate in water and lose 1 Heart each Turn they spend at least half submerged in liquid.",
          "originId": "colloid-corpus",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Colloid Corpus "
        },
        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Corrosive Contact [B]",
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "id": "xMdTvVujYo5mJDEiMD2v",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": null,
          "originId": "corrosive-contact-b",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "description": "*Caustic bodies destroy and consume.*\n\n**Attaching to Prey:**\n- Goops can attempt to stick onto a target in the same Battlefield Area as them. You can avoid this with a successful Deftness Check.\n- If a Goop attaches successfully to you it causes a Serious Burn from the Caustic/Burning Injury Table (p267), and again on every subsequent Turn until the Goop is dislodged or destroyed.\n\n**Removing Goop:**\n- You can use your Turn to attempt to remove a Goop. This requires a successful Might Check.\n\n**Attacking an attached Goop:**\n- If striking an attached Goop, the Goop’s prey takes the damage if the Attack roll is failed.\n\n**Corroding objects:**\n- Goops can damage objects softer than Very Hard by attaching to them. They corrode at a rate of 1 Heart per Turn.\n- The one exception to this is glass, which they cannot corrode."
        },
        {
