    "sheetData": {
      "abilities": [
        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Arcane Beleaguerment [B]",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "sQDB7CipkXZ8YpAYU0Oh",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "originId": "arcane-beleaguerment-b",
          "type": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "description": "*When all else fails, Lalka will sacrifice themselves to temporarily delay their foe. They can even coordinate their efforts with their fellow Lalka.*\n\nLalka can hurl themselves at you in a self-destructive attempt to slow you down.\n- Whether the attempt is successful or not, the Lalka is destroyed.\n\n**Breeze Lalka:**\n\n**Requires a Contest**\n- Lalkas Deftness vs. your Grit.\n- **Success:** The Lalka forces its way into an orifice and evaporates. You are Ballooned (p268) for 1 Turn.\n\n**Mud Lalka:**\n\n**Requires a Contest**\n- Lalkas Deftness VS. your Might.\n- **Success:** The Lalka splatters itself over your leg and hardens. You are Petrified for 1 Turn.\n  - Up to 3 Lalka can attempt this Ability together, each Lalka adds +2 to their Contest roll and prolongs the effect by 1 Turn.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null
        },
        {
          "description": "*Lalkas have a smidgen of elemental power.*\n\n**Breeze Lalka:**\n- Can summon a powerful breeze to:\n  - Push over, or move, an object no larger than 2 Inventory Slots.\n  - Distract or annoy you, providing an Attack Assist to an ally.\n  - Attempt to blow something out of your hand or Topple you (p271).\n\n**Requires a Contest**\n- Lalkas Aura VS. your Might.\n\n**Mud Lalka:**\n- Can sling grime pulled from their bodies as if a Thrown Weapon.\n- Adds 1 Bright Allegiance Point.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": null,
          "originId": "elemental-vex",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "id": "uLQ9aVTcNn4ZNm4QkfYr",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Elemental Vex "
        },
        {
          "originId": "mischievous-minuscule-b",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "subtext": "",
          "counters": {},
          "name": "Mischievous Minuscule [B]",
          "value": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "description": "*Lalka fit in the palm of your hand.*\n\nLalkas are Tiny.",
          "id": "r5hw13d1ofoRcVjmbsX1"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Communication",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "6p8s53J97FhFMRt3Xdyt",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "originId": "communication",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "description": "Lalka are able to\nspeak and understand Low Speech.\nThey tend to have squeaky voices.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null
        },
        {
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "id": "audk38OZ1MHfejystNzb",
          "name": "Customization",
          "value": 0,
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "More powerful Lalka\ncan reform after using Arcane\nBeleaguerment or have additional\nhexes like Mortifying Bloat or\nHocus Pox.",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "originId": "customization",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {}
        },
        {
          "description": "Lalka are never too far from\ntheir Lalka Jar, the pot or container in\nwhich they were created. A jar may\nbe positioned to protect a specific\nlocation or carried around by their\nmaster. If freed, Lalka gravitate to\nlocations related to their type. Breeze\nLalka settle in windy valleys and\ncaves.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "habitat",
          "subtext": null,
          "counters": {},
          "id": "cNa5r2xQSrvgXsQXzhIf",
          "modifiers": [],
          "linkedValue": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "name": "Habitat",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "VXZMqXiOBCm4S3guIhiW",
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "bonus": 0,
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Indicators",
          "description": "Overturned pots and\nfurniture, poorly timed pranks and\nother signs of childish mischief.",
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "starValue": null,
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "originId": "indicators",
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null
        },
        {
          "description": "Lalka have\nsimple thoughts. They are belligerent\nand difficult with everyone except\ntheir master or fellow Lalka. Lalka are\nhappy to hurl insults at you but can’t\nsustain any meaningful dialog.",
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "originId": "role-playing-notes",
          "type": "Quick Facts",
          "counterOverrides": {},
          "counters": {},
          "subtext": null,
          "linkedValue": null,
          "modifiers": [],
          "id": "TlCyoZuXhSzf9CPe5BAl",
          "valuePrefix": null,
          "bonus": 0,
          "value": 0,
          "name": "Role Playing Notes"
        },
        {
          "description": "Self-preservation is not a\nfactor when confronting foes, they:\n- Use Elemental Vex for hit and run attacks to weaken or distract foes.\n- Use Attack Assists to help their masters and employ Arcane Beleaguerment at key moments.",
          "starValue": null,
