        {
          "details": [
            {
              "visibility": "full",
              "type": "description",
              "value": {
                "description": "Range: 1 Area\nDamage: 1\nThreshold: 22\nLoading Time: None\n\n**Weapon Ability, Hidden Fangs:** \nIf your target isn’t aware of your Thrown Weapon, you may attempt to Ambush them, even when you are in plain sight.\n- Targets must be in Range, but otherwise this attack works like a normal Ambush (􀂴 p252).\n- If your Ambush is successful, others using Concealed or Thrown weapons can join in the Ambush."
              }
            }
          ],
