        "background": "",
        "details": "These hairy, serpentine\ncreatures wrap\nthemselves around\ntheir owners, keeping\nout of sight up sleeves\nor inside tunics. Their\nvenom can be milked,\ndiluted, and then sold as\nan anti-aging remedy. While this odd\nelixir does tighten the skin, the effect is\nonly temporary.",
