          "valuePrefix": null
        },
        {
          "starValue": null,
          "valueSuffix": null,
          "description": "Purrs\nare able to understand simple\ncommands like “Knock that over”\nor “Catch that”, but sometimes\nthey simply don’t feel like doing it.\nYou must make a successful Aura\nCheck to instruct your Purr.\n\nOnce per session, your GM\ncan direct your Purr to act\nindependently; this might prove\ncostly or useful. You must make an\nAura Check to stop them.",
