          "type": "Animal Ability",
          "id": "z6dYTwww54GTylYIJ8dn",
          "description": "On a Journey, this creature can act as a Scout with the following differences:\n- They get an Edge on their Stealth roll, as they are small and airborne. If detected, observers still might not think anything of it.\n- They cannot relay precise information, only indicate if the way ahead has: a serious threat, a potential threat, or no threat.",
