      "bio": {
        "name": "Jumbug",
        "appearance": "",
        "tokenCrop": "",
        "profileImage": null,
        "details": "Giant insectoids with\npowerful hind legs\nthat rocket them\nforwards. Notoriously\ndangerous to ride,\nthese beasts’ unusual\npropulsion method\nhelps them traverse the\nmost tortuous terrain. Jumbugs are also\nfamed for the soft chirping sounds they\nmake while settling down, soothing for\nboth owner and beast.",
