        "details": "Enormous, multi-legged\nand bulbous; Grubbish\nare awkward but\nstable beasts. Having\noriginated in the\nMana Wastes, these\ncreatures are extremely\nresilient, and this has\nmade them popular with travelers and\ntraders that operate in inhospitable\nlocations. Most Grubbish have a simple,\nmask-like face, but some rare specimens\nlook unnervingly human.",
