        },
        "details": "These humongous bovids\nhave a fluffy, charming\nappearance that\nbelies their rugged\nframe. Their strength,\ncoupled with a\ncompliant nature, make\nthem perfect beasts of\nburden. The Bumpo is a paternal animal,\nand will ‘adopt’ unattached youths, which\nthey will then vigorously defend."
      },
